  "source_code": "# cook your dish here\r\nMOD = 998244353\r\nk = []\r\nmaxi = 0\r\nfor _ in range(int(input())):\r\n    n = int(input())\r\n    a = list(map(int, input().split()))\r\n    k.append((n, a))\r\n    maxi = max(maxi, n)\r\n    \r\np = [0] * (maxi + 1)\r\nif maxi >= 1 :\r\n    p[1] = 1\r\nfor i in range(2, maxi + 1):\r\n    p[i] = MOD - (MOD // i) * p[MOD % i] % MOD \r\nq = [0] * (maxi + 1)\r\nfor i in range(1, maxi + 1):\r\n    q[i] = (q[i - 1] + p[i]) % MOD\r\nfor i,j in k:\r\n    c = 0\r\n    for t in range(i):\r\n        c1 = (q[t] + q[i - t - 1]) % MOD\r\n        c = (c + j[t] * c1) % MOD \r\n    print(c)\r\n    ",
